    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Schedule a 30-minute consultation.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Free, no commitment. We will walk through your situation and confirm whether we are a fit.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule Now</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609290,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609291,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Why does U.S. manufacturing matter for supplement brands?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Three reasons. Quality: U.S. manufacturers operate under FDA oversight with consistent enforcement. Supply chain: shorter lead times, lower freight costs, less disruption risk. Marketing: 'Made in USA' resonates with significant portions of supplement buyers and is verifiable in your marketing claims.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are you actually FDA-registered?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. Our Vermont facility has been continuously FDA-registered since the agency began requiring registration. We are also GMP-certified to NSF GMP 455-2, the most rigorous supplement-specific GMP standard.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Is U.S. manufacturing more expensive than overseas?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Per-unit it can be, depending on the formulation. Total landed cost (after shipping, duties, quality risk, and turnaround time) often makes U.S. manufacturing cost-competitive or better. Most clients who price it out side-by-side end up choosing U.S. manufacturing for reasons beyond just unit cost.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I tour the facility?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We host facility tours for prospective and active clients. Schedule through your account manager or the contact form.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What's the minimum order size to work with you?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most stock formulations have MOQs in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Specific MOQs depend on the formulation. We provide exact numbers during your consultation.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
